From 7065f059fae92a33bf0e2a9d0e37c4cc9aee9653 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Niccol=C3=B2=20Venerandi?= <niccolo@venerandi.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 17:55:11 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] applets/taskmanager: allow grouping single programs manually

"Do not group" left no way to group the windows of only some programs,
so it becomes "Manually", using the new GroupManually mode, and window
context menus get a "Group this program's windows" toggle to pick them.

BUG: 434700
